10
00:00:55,630 --> 00:00:58,200
(Mother's Name: Joo Ae Sook,
Baby DOB: September 11, 2000)

11
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:10,340
That's right.

12
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:14,610
The birth mother
you've been looking for...

13
00:01:16,410 --> 00:01:17,420
That's...

14
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:19,950
me.

15
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:24,760
It's you?

16
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:34,070
I'm sorry, Eun Seol.

17
00:01:42,510 --> 00:01:44,410
(Maternity Handbook)

18
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:48,010
Then why...

19
00:01:49,810 --> 00:01:52,320
Why did you never
look for me until now?

20
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:53,720
No.

21
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:58,360
Why did you abandon me?

22
00:02:01,490 --> 00:02:03,930
I...

23
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:06,730
That's what...

24
00:02:08,070 --> 00:02:09,570
Hee Jung wanted.

25
00:02:13,810 --> 00:02:14,840
My mom?

26
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:18,840
When I went to the hospital
where I had you,

27
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,710
Hee Jung had already taken you away.

28
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:25,850
After that, I spent a long time
searching for you.

29
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:30,490
I never imagined
that Hee Jung had taken you.

30
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,160
Back then, Hee Jung...

31
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:35,630
had just lost a child your age.

32
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:42,000
Even after that,
you never looked for me.

33
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,640
That was because of a promise
I made to Hee Jung.

34
00:02:50,110 --> 00:02:51,780
She threatened me.

35
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:56,050
She threatened to kill herself
if I took you.

36
00:03:00,890 --> 00:03:01,890
My mom...

37
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,160
Mom wouldn't have done that.

38
00:03:06,930 --> 00:03:08,160
Her obsession with you...

39
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,760
bordered on madness.

40
00:03:17,370 --> 00:03:18,370
Then...

41
00:03:20,100 --> 00:03:21,770
When I came to Cheongma,

42
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:25,410
you could've told the truth then.

43
00:03:28,550 --> 00:03:31,380
I don't know
what words Hee Jung left behind,

44
00:03:32,650 --> 00:03:34,290
but the family who raised you...

45
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:36,690
came looking for me.

46
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:41,090
They demanded money for raising you.

47
00:03:41,890 --> 00:03:45,030
I was just so terrified.

48
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,700
Money...

49
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:54,340
They asked for money?

50
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:42,050
Sir, I don't think
I can make it today.

51
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,320
I'm sorry.

52
00:05:02,810 --> 00:05:03,880
Come on.

53
00:05:04,140 --> 00:05:05,380
Don't.

54
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:07,080
There are plenty
of nice clothes here.

55
00:05:07,150 --> 00:05:08,150
I'll get you something.

56
00:05:08,210 --> 00:05:10,850
No, they clearly don't have
the new fall and winter collection.

57
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:13,690
- Isn't that CEO Park?
- Come on, let's head inside.

58
00:05:14,090 --> 00:05:15,990
I really don't like this place.

59
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:21,490
Wasn't he golfing
with Young Hoon today?

60
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:27,070
Mom, did you enjoy the show today?

61
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:28,930
Yes.

62
00:05:30,970 --> 00:05:31,970
Are you staying a bit longer?

63
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:33,810
Yes, I'd like some tea before I go.

64
00:05:34,610 --> 00:05:35,870
Is that okay with you, Mother?

65
00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:38,010
Oh, sure, of course.

66
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,080
All right, then I'll go wash up.

67
00:05:40,210 --> 00:05:41,580
- Okay.
- Here, Mom.

68
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:49,150
Ms. Park, let's talk.

69
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:51,860
Oh, sure.

70
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:53,730
You said you enjoyed the show,

71
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:55,130
so what's with the sour face?

72
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,560
I'm not that fond of you either.

73
00:05:58,830 --> 00:05:59,830
I wanted...

74
00:05:59,900 --> 00:06:02,830
to catch that show
with the nice lady.

75
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:04,670
Darn it. Ko Eun Seol again?

76
00:06:05,100 --> 00:06:06,940
Can you stop talking about her?

77
00:06:07,610 --> 00:06:08,740
Seriously.

78
00:06:09,010 --> 00:06:11,840
I'm sorry, Hae Ra.

79
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:14,350
If you keep this up,

80
00:06:14,410 --> 00:06:16,980
I'll have no choice
but to think of something nasty.

81
00:06:17,550 --> 00:06:18,980
Why do you keep pushing
my buttons...

82
00:06:19,050 --> 00:06:20,790
when you've got no idea
what I'll do to you?

83
00:06:21,890 --> 00:06:25,690
I'm sorry. I won't do it again.

84
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:28,190
Listen to me carefully, Ms. Park.

85
00:06:29,090 --> 00:06:31,660
If you want to keep living
with your precious son,

86
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,060
watch yourself.

87
00:06:33,700 --> 00:06:35,800
If you keep asking only
for Ko Eun Seol,

88
00:06:36,570 --> 00:06:38,100
I'll make you pay.

89
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:41,310
Mom, can you get me a towel?

90
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,310
Sure, Seok Jin. I'll get it.

91
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:49,650
You and I both get 80 dollars
for passing out flyers,

92
00:06:49,650 --> 00:06:50,780
making it 160 dollars total.

93
00:06:50,850 --> 00:06:53,450
Waiting in line at that famous restaurant
was 20 dollars...

94
00:06:54,090 --> 00:06:56,490
and picking up secondhand goods
was 30 dollars.

95
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:59,060
Altogether, that's 210 dollars.

96
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:02,490
Is that all we made?

97
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:07,000
- There are side gigs like this?
- What is it?

98
00:07:08,570 --> 00:07:11,100
Catching cockroaches?

99
00:07:11,770 --> 00:07:14,310
"I'll pay five dollars
for every roach you catch."

100
00:07:15,710 --> 00:07:17,880
Mom, this could be pretty lucrative.

101
00:07:18,740 --> 00:07:19,740
You little brat.

102
00:07:19,810 --> 00:07:21,010
Of all things
to ask your mother to do,

103
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,710
you want me to catch cockroaches?

104
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:28,420
That was because of a promise
I made to Hee Jung.

105
00:07:29,790 --> 00:07:31,620
She threatened me.

106
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:35,760
She threatened to kill herself
if I took you.

107
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,340
Ko Eun Seol...

108
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:48,170
She seemed to believe it
without a single doubt.

109
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:49,610
For now,

110
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,110
I'll play the desperate mother...

111
00:07:52,810 --> 00:07:55,150
and blind Ko Eun Seol to the truth.

112
00:07:59,050 --> 00:08:00,550
Ma'am, you're back.

113
00:08:01,490 --> 00:08:03,450
Gosh, Director Joo.

114
00:08:04,060 --> 00:08:05,820
Didn't you go on that trip
with your friend?

115
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:09,590
My friend fell ill,
so the trip got canceled.

116
00:08:10,190 --> 00:08:13,100
Oh dear, you were really
looking forward to it.

117
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,370
What a shame.

118
00:08:16,070 --> 00:08:17,570
Right, get some rest, then.

119
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:18,970
Yes, ma'am.

120
00:08:37,690 --> 00:08:41,760
Mom.
Uncle Jokbal is so good at soccer.

121
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:43,290
It was so much fun.

122
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:44,700
Was it?

123
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Yes.

124
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,930
He's way better than Uncle Hyun Jae,
who's away on business.

125
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:53,040
He said we should play soccer
together again next time.

126
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,920
Teun Teun's mom.

127
00:09:05,780 --> 00:09:07,180
This time, we'll see to it...

128
00:09:07,950 --> 00:09:10,350
that Attorney Seo gets justice.

129
00:09:11,090 --> 00:09:12,160
So,

130
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:14,760
please give us a chance
just this once.

131
00:09:27,340 --> 00:09:28,810
Eun Seol, is something up?

132
00:09:30,940 --> 00:09:32,240
You aren't feeling sick, are you?

133
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,080
No, I'm just a little tired.

134
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:37,620
I see.

135
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:43,890
Well, now that Team Leader Kang
has joined the scholarship project,

136
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:47,090
it does seem like you have
a lot more on your plate.

137
00:09:52,330 --> 00:09:55,070
By the way, about Director Joo...

138
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:59,140
Did she often visit the orphanage...

139
00:09:59,670 --> 00:10:01,370
where you grew up?

140
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:02,670
No.

141
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:04,710
She stayed behind the scenes,

142
00:10:04,710 --> 00:10:06,740
quietly sending scholarship funds.

143
00:10:07,780 --> 00:10:10,480
She did drop by once
every 2 or 3 years,

144
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,380
but it wasn't often.

145
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,590
She prefers not to show off
her good deeds.

146
00:10:16,650 --> 00:10:18,990
That's why I respect her even more.

147
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,200
You want to help...

148
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:27,260
with the correctional
scholarship program?

149
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,000
Yes.

150
00:10:29,230 --> 00:10:31,200
I feel like I haven't paid
enough attention to it,

151
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:33,370
leaving it all to Secretary Choi
all this time.

152
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,040
Sure.

153
00:10:35,110 --> 00:10:39,610
We'd certainly welcome your help
with the scholarship program.

154
00:10:40,410 --> 00:10:44,080
But didn't you share
my husband's view on this?

155
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:46,580
That was the impression I got.

156
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,250
No, not at all.

157
00:10:49,490 --> 00:10:51,920
I have always supported you, ma'am.

158
00:10:52,390 --> 00:10:53,690
And above all,

159
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:56,490
Hae Ra is helping
with the scholarship program now.

160
00:10:56,790 --> 00:10:58,360
I can't just sit back
and do nothing.

161
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:04,300
Then will you be attending
the meetings with us from now on?

162
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:07,100
Yes, that's my plan.

163
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:09,310
All right.

164
00:11:10,310 --> 00:11:11,580
Thank you, Director Joo.

165
00:11:14,610 --> 00:11:15,650
Eun Seol.

166
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:22,220
For the time being,

167
00:11:22,290 --> 00:11:24,420
let's keep our relationship
a secret at work.

168
00:11:24,620 --> 00:11:27,590
No one at the company knows
about my past.

169
00:11:28,330 --> 00:11:30,730
You must be very busy lately.

170
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,930
No, ma'am. I'm doing fine.

171
00:11:34,230 --> 00:11:37,840
Take care of your health
no matter how busy you are.

172
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,200
Don't skip your meals.

173
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,240
Yes, ma'am. Thank you.

174
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:44,310
I'll see you around.

175
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:06,700
Sir, I don't think
I can make it today.

176
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,000
I'm sorry.

177
00:12:16,470 --> 00:12:17,580
Are you still not done?

178
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,640
- Hey.
- You asked me to lunch.

179
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:21,010
What about Director Joo?

180
00:12:21,110 --> 00:12:23,750
She's skipping lunch
because her stomach is upset.

181
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,050
Is that so?

182
00:12:27,690 --> 00:12:29,020
Hold on a second.

183
00:12:31,690 --> 00:12:35,030
Who did you go on this trip with?

184
00:12:38,230 --> 00:12:40,360
I saw CEO Park at the boutique,

185
00:12:40,700 --> 00:12:43,870
and he was with a very young woman.

186
00:12:46,970 --> 00:12:50,510
Tell me the truth.
Who were you actually with?

187
00:12:51,210 --> 00:12:54,780
CEO Park, that jerk.

188
00:12:54,850 --> 00:12:56,380
He couldn't even wait.

189
00:12:56,710 --> 00:12:57,850
Hold on.

190
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:01,020
Did you know
about CEO Park's affair?

191
00:13:01,250 --> 00:13:03,990
Yes. CEO Park begged me
so desperately...

192
00:13:03,990 --> 00:13:06,090
that I had no choice.

193
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:08,590
He swore
he'd break things off with her...

194
00:13:08,660 --> 00:13:11,130
if I just gave him an alibi
this once.

195
00:13:12,830 --> 00:13:15,830
So you helped cover up
CEO Park's affair?

196
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:17,740
What else was I supposed to do?

197
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:21,440
Should I have told Si Hyun's mom
and made them get a divorce?

198
00:13:21,810 --> 00:13:24,340
CEO Park promised
he'd clean up his act...

199
00:13:24,410 --> 00:13:26,710
if I covered for him just this once.

200
00:13:27,110 --> 00:13:28,910
That jerk is unbelievable.

201
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,920
How could he just lie to my face?

202
00:13:32,050 --> 00:13:33,050
Then...

203
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:36,020
where were you last night?

204
00:13:36,650 --> 00:13:37,920
Don't tell me you were...

205
00:13:40,890 --> 00:13:42,930
Look, see this?

206
00:13:44,130 --> 00:13:46,960
You know how much breakfast
at this hotel costs, right?

207
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:50,600
I just spent the day resting
by myself at the hotel.

208
00:13:50,770 --> 00:13:54,510
You're not the only one
who needed some time alone.

209
00:13:57,510 --> 00:14:00,680
Well,
if you really don't believe me,

210
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:02,480
you can go check
with the hotel yourself.

211
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:05,280
Is that the truth?

212
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:07,120
You weren't doing
the exact same thing?

213
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:12,160
Whether you believe me or not
is entirely up to you.

214
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:14,690
Then, what should I tell
Si Hyun's mom...

215
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:17,030
We have to keep it a secret,
of course.

216
00:14:17,030 --> 00:14:19,460
That is, if you care
about my position at all.

217
00:14:22,900 --> 00:14:24,070
Come on, let's go.

218
00:14:24,170 --> 00:14:26,270
I've been thinking about it
for the past few days.

219
00:14:29,210 --> 00:14:30,270
Fine.

220
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:32,710
About your family moving...

221
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:34,580
and your part-time job...

222
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:38,080
For now,
I'll give it a little more thought.

223
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:40,920
Really?

224
00:14:42,050 --> 00:14:44,090
You made the right choice, boss.

225
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:50,460
I really want to stay by your side.

226
00:14:54,730 --> 00:14:59,370
Actually,
your father came to see me.

227
00:15:02,010 --> 00:15:04,210
- My dad?
- Yes.

228
00:15:05,940 --> 00:15:07,950
He got down on his knees.

229
00:15:12,050 --> 00:15:13,720
Seeing him made me
realize something.

230
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:19,420
It isn't like I don't understand
how parents feel.

231
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:22,630
So that's what he did.

232
00:15:24,060 --> 00:15:25,360
The thing is, Eun Guk,

233
00:15:27,030 --> 00:15:28,030
I'm...

234
00:15:28,430 --> 00:15:30,700
still not ready to face Eun Seol.

235
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:33,800
Seeing your father makes me feel
like I should understand it all,

236
00:15:34,710 --> 00:15:35,710
and I know...

237
00:15:35,770 --> 00:15:38,940
it's not like Eun Seol meant
for that to happen to Hyun Jae.

238
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,350
Still,

239
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:45,050
I haven't sorted out my feelings
toward her just yet.

240
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:47,350
I understand.

241
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:52,490
I don't know how long it'll take
for me to come to terms with her,

242
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:56,630
but I'll take my time
thinking about it.

243
00:15:57,290 --> 00:15:58,300
Sure.

244
00:15:59,130 --> 00:16:01,770
I'm sure Eun Seol will understand
where you're coming from.

245
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:07,710
You know this, right?

246
00:16:09,140 --> 00:16:10,870
I really care about you a lot.

247
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:22,720
Come on.

248
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:24,190
How am I supposed to handle
you looking this pretty...

249
00:16:24,250 --> 00:16:25,590
even when you cry?

250
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:32,930
Seriously, Mi Rae,
you're being unfair.

251
00:16:33,700 --> 00:16:35,270
Did you just call me by my name?

252
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:38,300
Should I call you "babe" instead?

253
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:41,210
Or how about "ma'am?"

254
00:16:42,670 --> 00:16:45,140
Wait, "milady" sounds nice too.

255
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:47,040
- Unbelievable.
- Milady.

256
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:48,210
Stop it.

257
00:16:50,010 --> 00:16:51,450
Unbelievable.

258
00:16:52,420 --> 00:16:54,550
I've always wanted
to take care of you,

259
00:16:55,190 --> 00:16:57,760
but I held myself back.

260
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,390
Here.

261
00:17:03,590 --> 00:17:05,460
What is this?

262
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:08,200
Vitamins.

263
00:17:09,670 --> 00:17:12,470
Every time I hold your hands,
they're always so cold.

264
00:17:13,170 --> 00:17:14,470
Mine were like that, too.

265
00:17:15,370 --> 00:17:18,480
I was amazed that you could
take after me even in that.

266
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,750
I see.

267
00:17:24,210 --> 00:17:25,250
Eun Seol.

268
00:17:27,380 --> 00:17:28,720
I know I'm far from perfect,

269
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:31,820
but going forward,
I want to care for you...

270
00:17:32,590 --> 00:17:34,160
as your mom,

271
00:17:34,990 --> 00:17:37,960
not your superior
or your mom's friend.

272
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,100
Can I do that?

273
00:17:42,270 --> 00:17:44,070
I'm still...

274
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:45,870
Yes,

275
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:47,840
I understand how you feel.

276
00:17:48,910 --> 00:17:52,010
It can't be easy to accept me
as your mom yet.

277
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:55,710
So I'll try my best.

278
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:58,580
All you have to do is watch.

279
00:17:59,780 --> 00:18:01,120
Could you do that for me?

280
00:18:10,130 --> 00:18:12,700
Seok Jin,
just throwing this out there,

281
00:18:12,830 --> 00:18:14,970
but maybe we should look
for a nursing home.

282
00:18:15,230 --> 00:18:17,800
It'd be good for your mother
to get fresh air...

283
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:18,900
and make some friends.

284
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:22,870
I don't mean permanently,
just for a month or two.

285
00:18:23,310 --> 00:18:25,040
So she can clear her head for a bit.

286
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,910
Can't you show my mother
some sympathy?

287
00:18:30,610 --> 00:18:33,380
Everyone else feels sorry for her.

288
00:18:33,450 --> 00:18:36,350
Why are you the only one
so bent on tearing her down?

289
00:18:36,420 --> 00:18:38,920
Everyone else, as in who?
Ko Eun Seol?

290
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,230
Your son's here, Mom.

291
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:50,970
Hey. You're back, Mr. Seok Jin.

292
00:18:52,870 --> 00:18:54,270
What did you do today?

293
00:18:54,810 --> 00:18:59,010
I gathered another big pile
of fallen leaves today.

294
00:18:59,540 --> 00:19:01,680
When will you make bookmarks
out of all these?

295
00:19:01,850 --> 00:19:03,180
Your hands will ache, Mom.

296
00:19:03,180 --> 00:19:04,550
It's all right.

297
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,420
Today,

298
00:19:06,550 --> 00:19:08,620
I'm going to make one
for Hae Ra, too.

299
00:19:09,850 --> 00:19:11,050
For Hae Ra, too?

300
00:19:11,620 --> 00:19:14,960
Yes, Hae Ra will love it
if she gets one.

301
00:19:15,490 --> 00:19:16,830
What brought this on?

302
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:18,300
Making one for Hae Ra and all.

303
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:20,160
Even a withered flower...

304
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:24,840
can come back to life
if you keep telling it it's pretty.

305
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:29,310
Even if I dislike Hae Ra,
maybe if I keep complimenting her,

306
00:19:29,570 --> 00:19:32,240
she'll actually change.

307
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,950
I'm home.

308
00:19:38,150 --> 00:19:39,250
You're back?

309
00:19:39,380 --> 00:19:42,190
How about kimchi stew
for dinner tonight?

310
00:19:42,590 --> 00:19:44,020
- Sounds good.
- Good.

311
00:19:47,290 --> 00:19:50,690
The family who raised you
came looking for me.

312
00:19:51,730 --> 00:19:54,730
They demanded money for raising you.

313
00:19:55,370 --> 00:19:57,230
I was just so terrified.

314
00:20:01,670 --> 00:20:04,070
What is it?
Do you have something to say?

315
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:07,910
No, it's nothing.

316
00:20:11,050 --> 00:20:13,120
Did you make sure my wife is asleep?

317
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:16,590
Yes, I checked.

318
00:20:17,450 --> 00:20:18,660
That day...

319
00:20:19,990 --> 00:20:21,960
Why didn't you keep your promise?

320
00:20:22,290 --> 00:20:24,230
Something urgent came up.

321
00:20:24,430 --> 00:20:25,500
I'm sorry.

322
00:20:28,430 --> 00:20:29,430
Director Joo.

323
00:20:33,540 --> 00:20:34,670
What are we...

324
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:39,040
to each other?

325
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:49,450
What are you asking?

326
00:20:51,620 --> 00:20:52,760
If by any chance...

327
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:55,590
you're thinking of playing hard
to get with me,

328
00:20:56,460 --> 00:20:58,200
you'd better drop that idea.

329
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,900
You see,

330
00:21:03,270 --> 00:21:05,340
I don't trust people easily.

331
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:09,340
So I always tend to watch my back.

332
00:21:11,070 --> 00:21:12,080
Right.

333
00:21:13,340 --> 00:21:14,340
Of course,

334
00:21:15,680 --> 00:21:18,220
I do my fair share
of backstabbing, too.

335
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:23,520
Director Joo.

336
00:21:29,490 --> 00:21:31,500
Whenever I side with you,

337
00:21:32,230 --> 00:21:34,330
I always have a good reason.

338
00:21:35,500 --> 00:21:36,800
You shouldn't mistake that...

339
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:38,700
for simple romantic attraction,
should you?

340
00:21:41,070 --> 00:21:44,470
I understand what you mean.

341
00:21:46,940 --> 00:21:48,010
Right.

342
00:21:48,380 --> 00:21:50,810
You aren't that foolish
of a person, are you?

343
00:21:52,580 --> 00:21:56,190
Next time something comes up,
tell me in advance.

344
00:21:56,520 --> 00:21:57,890
Don't cancel on me...

345
00:21:58,320 --> 00:21:59,790
out of nowhere like that.

346
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:01,960
Understood?

347
00:22:03,830 --> 00:22:06,760
In the end, feelings like this...

348
00:22:08,070 --> 00:22:10,000
are all just business, aren't they?

349
00:22:16,010 --> 00:22:17,010
Sir.

350
00:22:19,040 --> 00:22:21,480
My feelings are sincere.

351
00:22:28,990 --> 00:22:30,190
I know I'm far from perfect,

352
00:22:31,050 --> 00:22:33,460
but going forward,
I want to care for you...

353
00:22:34,220 --> 00:22:35,760
as your mom,

354
00:22:36,660 --> 00:22:39,600
not your superior
or your mom's friend.

355
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,430
Can I do that?

356
00:22:46,270 --> 00:22:49,610
Then why did she pretend
not to know me all this time?

357
00:22:53,010 --> 00:22:55,980
Why is she only now
revealing the truth?

358
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:02,890
I want to see you right now.

359
00:23:03,490 --> 00:23:04,990
I'll wait in the office.

360
00:23:25,710 --> 00:23:26,980
Why does she want to meet again?

361
00:23:27,040 --> 00:23:28,710
What is she trying
to dig up this time?

362
00:24:16,790 --> 00:24:18,200
This was lying around.

363
00:24:20,530 --> 00:24:21,930
Doesn't something feel off to you?

364
00:24:22,370 --> 00:24:24,700
I grabbed it just in case.

365
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:34,140
Sorry about this.
I bet you've been waiting long.

366
00:24:34,850 --> 00:24:38,150
We could've just met
at a nearby cafe, you know.

367
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:40,620
Why did you want to meet
in the office?

368
00:24:42,890 --> 00:24:44,050
We wouldn't want anyone...

369
00:24:45,220 --> 00:24:46,820
overhearing us.

370
00:24:49,390 --> 00:24:52,400
It's not as if I could just
drop by your place, either.

371
00:24:53,700 --> 00:24:55,670
Oh, I see.

372
00:24:56,670 --> 00:24:57,670
Sure.

373
00:24:57,670 --> 00:24:58,800
Thinking of it that way,

374
00:24:58,800 --> 00:25:00,640
the office may be
the most comfortable.

375
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:03,470
Anyway,

376
00:25:04,110 --> 00:25:05,340
did something happen?

377
00:25:07,410 --> 00:25:10,050
I just had so many questions.

378
00:25:11,780 --> 00:25:13,320
I couldn't sleep at all.

379
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:17,290
Yes, I understand.

380
00:25:19,060 --> 00:25:21,890
What could my daughter be
so curious about?

381
00:25:23,630 --> 00:25:25,030
I get it all,

382
00:25:25,730 --> 00:25:28,160
so take a breath
and ask whatever you want.

383
00:25:31,700 --> 00:25:34,700
Why now, of all times?

384
00:25:37,810 --> 00:25:39,280
The fact
that you're my biological mother...

385
00:25:40,910 --> 00:25:42,980
You could've told me that...

386
00:25:44,450 --> 00:25:46,220
the first day I showed up.

387
00:25:50,950 --> 00:25:52,020
I told you.

388
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:55,630
- I promised Hee Jung...
- No.

389
00:25:58,360 --> 00:26:00,660
Stop using my mom as an excuse.

390
00:26:04,730 --> 00:26:05,770
All right.

391
00:26:06,340 --> 00:26:07,670
I'll be honest with you.

392
00:26:10,170 --> 00:26:12,380
The fact
that I'm your biological mother...

393
00:26:13,210 --> 00:26:16,050
I planned to keep it a secret
until the end.

394
00:26:19,180 --> 00:26:21,020
Part of it was
my promise to Hee Jung,

395
00:26:22,420 --> 00:26:23,850
but you and I...

396
00:26:25,120 --> 00:26:26,460
We've been living stable lives...

397
00:26:27,190 --> 00:26:28,760
suited to our current reality.

398
00:26:30,290 --> 00:26:31,760
I was planning...

399
00:26:33,330 --> 00:26:35,900
to help you with your retrial later.

400
00:26:35,970 --> 00:26:37,230
Exactly.

401
00:26:37,870 --> 00:26:39,170
So why come...

402
00:26:40,770 --> 00:26:42,110
looking for me only now?

403
00:26:43,340 --> 00:26:44,340
Why?

404
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:47,010
Is it because
I've been digging into your past?

405
00:26:48,550 --> 00:26:49,550
No.

406
00:26:52,150 --> 00:26:54,150
Because even Team Leader Seo
isn't here anymore.

407
00:26:56,190 --> 00:27:00,160
Hee Jung and Team Leader Seo,
who protected you all this time,

408
00:27:01,090 --> 00:27:02,790
are both gone now.

409
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:07,300
I thought you wouldn't
have anyone left...

410
00:27:07,360 --> 00:27:09,900
to lean on or rely on anymore.

411
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,570
Even if I'm not enough,

412
00:27:13,170 --> 00:27:15,740
I wanted to protect you as your mom.

413
00:27:15,970 --> 00:27:18,240
If you were going to tell me anyway,

414
00:27:19,140 --> 00:27:22,010
you should've come
looking for me sooner.

415
00:27:25,020 --> 00:27:26,050
If you had,

416
00:27:28,220 --> 00:27:30,220
then Attorney Seo...

417
00:27:31,250 --> 00:27:33,620
wouldn't have ended up like that
because of me.

418
00:27:35,360 --> 00:27:38,560
Why did you come find me now
of all times? Why?

419
00:27:42,830 --> 00:27:43,830
You're right.

420
00:27:44,900 --> 00:27:45,900
That's why...

421
00:27:46,670 --> 00:27:49,410
I'm regretting it so much right now.

422
00:28:00,420 --> 00:28:04,250
Eun Seol, what's wrong?
Do you have a fever?

423
00:28:09,190 --> 00:28:10,490
If you regret it so much,

424
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:15,570
you can just admit right now
that you're my real mother.

425
00:28:16,930 --> 00:28:18,800
Wouldn't that be helping me?

426
00:28:20,800 --> 00:28:23,740
No, absolutely not.

427
00:28:38,590 --> 00:28:41,060
In the end, driven by your greed
to stay at Cheongma,

428
00:28:42,490 --> 00:28:43,830
you're abandoning me again.

429
00:28:49,230 --> 00:28:50,230
That's not it.

430
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:52,800
I couldn't...

431
00:28:53,700 --> 00:28:56,310
endure the beatings anymore.

432
00:29:00,080 --> 00:29:01,480
Your so-called father...

433
00:29:02,450 --> 00:29:04,710
beat me half to death
every single day.

434
00:29:06,320 --> 00:29:07,420
You're...

435
00:29:08,120 --> 00:29:09,720
my daughter,

436
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:14,560
but you're also a past
I want to erase.

437
00:29:17,290 --> 00:29:18,560
Your father...

438
00:29:19,730 --> 00:29:21,600
Even though he knew
I was pregnant with you,

439
00:29:22,300 --> 00:29:24,030
he beat me every day.

440
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:27,970
That's why I ran away
from that man...

441
00:29:28,510 --> 00:29:30,310
and gave birth to you in secret.

442
00:29:33,940 --> 00:29:34,940
Right.

443
00:29:36,050 --> 00:29:39,550
To you right now,
it might all sound like excuses.

444
00:29:41,780 --> 00:29:43,150
I'm sorry, Eun Seol.

445
00:29:43,890 --> 00:29:46,420
Please forgive your mom. Please?

446
00:30:13,580 --> 00:30:14,620
Mom!

447
00:30:35,970 --> 00:30:39,080
I didn't look for you because
of a promise I made to Hee Jung.

448
00:30:40,040 --> 00:30:41,840
She threatened me.

449
00:30:42,650 --> 00:30:45,750
She threatened to kill herself
if I took you.

450
00:30:50,990 --> 00:30:51,990
No...

451
00:30:54,060 --> 00:30:55,120
No way.

452
00:30:56,190 --> 00:30:58,130
No, Mom would never have done that.

453
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:03,330
Mom would never have done that.
No way.

454
00:31:09,610 --> 00:31:10,640
Eun Seol, are you sick?

455
00:31:11,140 --> 00:31:12,210
You don't look well.

456
00:31:13,210 --> 00:31:14,980
If you're feeling that awful,
take off early.

457
00:31:15,350 --> 00:31:17,980
She's right.
We'll speak to Ms. Kang for you.

458
00:31:18,650 --> 00:31:21,250
No. Really, I'm fine.

459
00:31:28,290 --> 00:31:29,360
You should talk to her.

460
00:31:43,770 --> 00:31:44,770
Eun...

461
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:51,510
Eun Seol?

462
00:32:00,690 --> 00:32:01,690
Eun Seol.

463
00:32:03,490 --> 00:32:04,490
Ko Eun Seol.

464
00:32:07,430 --> 00:32:08,430
Mom...

465
00:32:18,570 --> 00:32:20,210
That's right, Eun Seol.

466
00:32:30,720 --> 00:32:33,490
It's me, your mom.

467
00:33:05,560 --> 00:33:09,490
(A Trap Called Desire)

468
00:33:09,490 --> 00:33:11,790
Does the company offer
any employee loans?

469
00:33:11,790 --> 00:33:14,830
Can we take out a loan in your name?

470
00:33:14,830 --> 00:33:17,270
No, they're probably
just similar gloves.

471
00:33:17,270 --> 00:33:20,240
Who would've thought I'd ever
be grateful to An Guk Cheol?

472
00:33:20,300 --> 00:33:22,440
Is Ko Eun Seol
holding something over you?

473
00:33:22,510 --> 00:33:24,440
This is the design school
Hae Ra attended.

474
00:33:24,510 --> 00:33:25,980
It's bound to help.

475
00:33:26,040 --> 00:33:27,310
Did you see the lighter
that was here?

476
00:33:27,380 --> 00:33:28,980
I'm certain I left it right here.

477
00:33:29,080 --> 00:33:31,080
Who lives with their in-laws
these days?

478
00:33:31,150 --> 00:33:33,350
Ms. Park,
do I look like a joke to you?

479
00:33:33,420 --> 00:33:36,050
Because of you,
Seok Jin and I keep drifting apart.

480
00:33:36,420 --> 00:33:38,220
This is all your fault!

481
00:33:39,120 --> 00:33:41,090
(Subtitle are provided by KOCOWA.)
